<title>UK: AKER RGI sets $150 million exchangeable bond.</title>
<headline>AKER RGI sets $150 million exchangeable bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following exchangeable bond was announced by lead manager Lehman Brothers.</p>
<p> BORROWER   AKER RGI ASA</p>
<p> AMT    $150 MLN	COUPON  ** 4.75-5.25 MATURITY	   2002</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    23.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.5	 REOFFER    =	   IND PREMIUM 18-22 PCT</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> NOTES    **INDICATED. 3-YEAR HARD NON-CALL</p>
<p>		EXCHANGEABLE INTO ORDINARY SHARES OF AKER MARITIME</p>
<p>		ASA</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
